{
  "name": "cps_basic_monthly",
  "description": "Subset of the Census/BLS CPS Basic Monthly public-use file layout (2003+ record format). Positions are 1-based and inclusive, taken from the CPS basic monthly data dictionary. Verify against the dictionary shipped with your own extract and override with --layout if it differs.",
